(2383, 'caraṇa', 'c araṇa : (S) 1. foot; journey; religious c eremony. 2. ground, base, bottom. 3. (S racaṇā) ornament, decoration, embellishment; c inaraṇa decorated. Kawi Lexicon, Wojowasito, 1980, #575.', 3),
(2384, 'calana', 'c alana : (S c alanaka) trousers, breeches. Kawi Lexicon, Wojowasito, 1980, #575.', 2),
