(3200, 'dronjong', 'd ronjong (drOnjOG) : n-[x] êngg. kn mayat bangêt tmr. d alan, payon lsp; [x]-an papan sing n; kc. d rojog. Bausastra Jawa, Poerwadarminta, 1939, #75.', 6),
