(3272, 'êmbil', 'ê mbil (|mbIl) : di-[x] ê ngg 1 dijupuk, dipèk; 2 dipêthik; 3 pc. didhèp, dicèp. Bausastra Jawa, Poerwadarminta, 1939, #75.', 6),
