(6822, 'Ir.', 'I r. : see I NSINYUR. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 3),
(6823, 'irah', 'i rah : [x]-[x]-an 1 theme, basic i dea. 2 clarification, analysis. 3 wy a certain type of male dancer''s headdress. ng/di-[x]-[x]- i to take as a theme. crita cêkak sing di-[x]-[x]- i sêjarah a short story based on history. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 1),
