(6838, 'ithêm', 'i thêm : vary black ( i ntensified form of I RÊNG). Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 7),
(6839, 'itikad', 'i tikad : var of I KTIKAD. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 3),
(6840, 'icêr', 'i cêr : ng/di-[x] to go after, try for (var of NG/DI- I NCÊR). Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 1),
(6841, 'icir', 'i cir : a certain type of fish trap with barred doors. ng/di-[x]-[x] to scatter untidily. Bêrase di-[x]-[x] i ng jubin. The rice was spilled on the floor. ng/di-[x](-[x]) to sell i n small quantities (rg var of NG/DI-ÈCÈR). Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 2),
