(11365, 'obat', 'o bat : 1 gunpowder. [x] mimis bullet, ammunition. 2 chemicals; drugs. [x] turu sleeping pill. [x] kramas powdered shampoo. [x] kuwat a tonic. [x] nyamuk mosquito repellent. [x] cacing vermifuge. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 4),
