(11392, 'ote', 'o te : [x]-[x] undressed, naked. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 2),
(11393, 'ocèh', 'o cèh : [x]-[x]-an a talking bird. ng-[x] 1 to talk mindlessly. Menco bisa ng-[x]. Mynah birds talk. Bayine kok wis pintêr ng-[x]. How the baby babbles! 2 slang to talk too much; to gossip. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 2),
