(11396, 'otomobil', 'o tomobil : automobile. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 4),
(11397, 'otonom', 'o tonom : having autonomy. pêmêrintah [x] an autonomous government. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 5),
