(14075, 'suling', 's uling : a gamelan blowing instrument, usu. of bamboo, with a flute-like tone, helf vertically like an oboe. tukang [x] player of this instrument. ny-[x] 1 to play the above. 2 (psv di-[x]) to distill. nyuling lênga wangi to distill perfume. pa-ny-[x] act or way of playing the above instrument. Panyulinge ... selengkapnya s uling : a gamelan blowing instrument, usu. of bamboo, with a flute-like tone, helf vertically like an oboe. tukang [x] player of this instrument. ny-[x] 1 to play the above. 2 (psv di-[x]) to distill. nyuling lênga wangi to distill perfume. pa-ny-[x] act or way of playing the above instrument. Panyulinge apik. He plays the s uling beautifully. pa-ny-[x]-an a distillation. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 2),
