(14107, 'saraf', 's araf [Ind] : I paramasastra bab rêrimbaganing têmbung; ''ilmu s araf: paramasastra. II s arap, talirasa. Bausastra Indonesia-Jawi, Purwadarminta, c. 1939, #1979.', 2),
