(14571, 'tata dhahar', 't ata dhahar (tOtO Dahar) : (mangan) Ng., t ata dhahar Kr.; t o lay t he t able. Giri Sonta Course for Javanese (Lexicon), Bakker, 1964, #286.', 9),
(14572, 'tas', 't as () : Ng., t as Kr.; handbag. Giri Sonta Course for Javanese (Lexicon), Bakker, 1964, #286.', 10),
