(16578, 'rahas(i)ya', 'rahas(i) y a : oj secret. mbocorake [x] nêgara to leak a state secret. pulisi [x] secret police. ng/di-[x]-kake to keep sth secret. Javanese-English Dictionary, Horne, 1974, #1968.', 8),
